{"kind":"component","id":"633ece8c-10bf-468e-949d-05a2487766f4","type":"57bf0fdb-b333-491c-b9eb-50783029b8c2","name":"Concrete (Alpaca4d)","nick":"Concrete","desc":"A concrete law for the fibres of a section, from the Law menu. Compression is negative, stresses in kN/m2, strains dimensionless.\nConcrete01 - a parabola to the peak, a straight fall to the crushing strain, no tension (the default);\nConcrete02 - the same with a tensile strength and a linear tension softening;\nConcrete04 - Popovics' curve, and an exponential tension branch when you give fct and et.","box":[0,120,86,124],"pivot":[45,182],"inputs":[{"id":"e0329190-057a-40bd-b05e-cdb87f17574c","name":"Material Name","nick":"MatName","box":[2,122,28,20],"src":[]},{"id":"2d1e9483-51df-4476-a6a4-6c05f2132d64","name":"fco","nick":"fco","box":[2,142,28,20],"src":[]},{"id":"48a0c872-afee-4738-90a5-af91f2267e97","name":"fcu","nick":"fcu","box":[2,162,28,20],"src":[]},{"id":"24407d37-cdd8-4d4a-9eca-37a46499b8aa","name":"EpsilonCo","nick":"EpsilonCo","box":[2,182,28,20],"src":[]},{"id":"9c00e6af-6e43-46c1-be5e-df40c4e9cf5f","name":"EpsilonCu","nick":"EpsilonCu","box":[2,202,28,20],"src":[]},{"id":"22f98c40-20e6-4c55-9bf7-3b0c6da5715e","name":"MinMax","nick":"MinMax","box":[2,222,28,20],"src":[]}],"outputs":[{"id":"75eaa4c2-6727-429a-a8de-8232e4061ba0","name":"Material","nick":"Material","box":[60,122,24,120],"src":[]}],"unit":"Concrete01"},
{"kind":"component","id":"9905387b-a749-4bc8-a7bc-90794fe0de75","type":"deb86811-4429-426f-8a7b-02df89c5a074","name":"Steel (Alpaca4d)","nick":"Bars","desc":"A steel law for the fibres of a section, from the Law menu. Stresses in kN/m2, strains dimensionless.\nSteel01 - bilinear with kinematic hardening (the default);\nSteel02 - Giuffre-Menegotto-Pinto: the same, with a smooth elastic to plastic transition;\nReinforcingSteel - a reinforcing bar, with a strain-hardening branch to its ultimate strength.","box":[0,400,87,200],"pivot":[44,482],"inputs":[{"id":"d3e94ceb-0246-442c-8134-6f4fc3914dda","name":"Material Name","nick":"MatName","box":[2,402,27,20],"src":[]},{"id":"988fc040-6f32-4f3f-b444-1adba8566ecc","name":"fy","nick":"fy","box":[2,422,27,20],"src":[]},{"id":"5d1da123-b021-4897-9776-2e6076d4bd4c","name":"fu","nick":"fu","box":[2,442,27,20],"src":[]},{"id":"08f45dd2-a457-4773-91e6-cc7d070697a2","name":"Es","nick":"Es","box":[2,462,27,20],"src":[]},{"id":"eae72ea5-66cb-40fb-a18a-c211f4bd5f4a","name":"Esh","nick":"Esh","box":[2,482,27,20],"src":[]},{"id":"bc6e473c-3b46-43c8-8bae-010e70aff419","name":"esh","nick":"esh","box":[2,502,27,20],"src":[]},{"id":"8c8c3cd4-0651-4cc2-a5ba-a22c6b977ff2","name":"eult","nick":"eult","box":[2,522,27,20],"src":[]},{"id":"4fdeb9fb-4175-444d-980c-271cac6eb33a","name":"MinMax","nick":"MinMax","box":[2,542,27,20],"src":[]}],"outputs":[{"id":"6a84fac7-1a95-4e44-b181-fdb0db5795ed","name":"Material","nick":"Material","box":[59,402,26,160],"src":[]}],"unit":"ReinforcingSteel"},
