{"kind":"component","id":"6adfe4d2-8f54-4e21-acaf-9dd91aa17da2","type":"934021ce-8d12-4fca-8cf1-9158eb08208a","name":"Fiber Point(Alpaca4d)","nick":"phi 24 bars","desc":"One fibre of a fibre section - a point with an area and a material.\nCoordinates in m, area in m2. The point's X is the section's local y and its Y the local z.","box":[397,468,91,64],"pivot":[441,500],"inputs":[{"id":"26fa2a5b-723f-4645-b08e-440ff3e25637","name":"Point","nick":"Point","box":[399,470,27,20],"src":[]},{"id":"a3ba1261-0cd3-4672-a7a4-8372840b1a55","name":"AreaFiber","nick":"AreaFiber","box":[399,490,27,20],"src":[]},{"id":"eab187c2-7419-4fde-b803-bd2d90d2feb5","name":"Material","nick":"Material","box":[399,510,27,20],"src":["6a84fac7-1a95-4e44-b181-fdb0db5795ed"]}],"outputs":[{"id":"5c48588b-603e-423a-bbec-0124986e6939","name":"PointFiber","nick":"PointFiber","box":[456,470,30,60],"src":[]}]},
{"kind":"component","id":"b70d74e0-294c-4ee8-8de2-046f426d4f62","type":"18cd5969-e0e4-4acf-9790-0af2c22cfeb9","name":"Fiber Section (Alpaca4d)","nick":"FiberSection","desc":"Collects fibre points, layers and patches into one section.\nThe green y and blue z arrows are the section's local axes: y along world X, z along world Y, the way OpenSees writes a fibre. They are drawn at the area centroid of the fibres, the point moments are taken about. My and Mz - in Moment Curvature, Interaction Domain and its views - are moments about y and z by the right-hand rule, the beam's axis x coming out of the drawing (towards you in Top view): positive My stretches the +z side, positive Mz the -y side.","box":[608,140,97,84],"pivot":[652,182],"inputs":[{"id":"9f4b01e1-80b7-4713-809e-839d70d4ccf9","name":"PointFiber","nick":"PointFiber","box":[610,142,27,20],"src":["5c48588b-603e-423a-bbec-0124986e6939"]},{"id":"ff6a0995-e5d2-4605-b84a-464ca75afb7f","name":"Layer","nick":"Layer","box":[610,162,27,20],"src":[]},{"id":"7573ebb7-0755-4e1b-8c14-082770c518e6","name":"Patch","nick":"Patch","box":[610,182,27,20],"src":["bcd22438-5947-40aa-8972-f55630d05b72"]},{"id":"5b5df4ea-5d50-47af-9fc3-edc7790fe45c","name":"GJ","nick":"GJ","box":[610,202,27,20],"src":[]}],"outputs":[{"id":"2a143b47-b9ed-4cb0-b884-9bca93f496b3","name":"FiberSection","nick":"FiberSection","box":[667,142,36,80],"src":[]}]},
{"kind":"component","id":"deb09b11-148a-4b12-a6dd-8af689e69875","type":"5a456d82-1c30-4ee1-aac7-876846328c8f","name":"MomentCurvature (Alpaca4d)","nick":"MC","desc":"Pushes a fibre section's curvature in any moment direction under a held axial force, and returns the moment-curvature curve, the stress-strain history of every fibre, and the curve's first yield and ultimate state.\nThe ultimate state is the first fibre at its ultimate strain - Interaction Domain's limits: concrete at εcu, or εc2 at point C in full compression, everything else at εud - and the analysis stops there unless told not to.","box":[825,0,117,364],"pivot":[879,182],"inputs":[{"id":"8c8ef5a7-6010-4f27-8776-1cef47cdf67a","name":"FiberSection","nick":"FiberSection","box":[827,2,37,45],"src":["2a143b47-b9ed-4cb0-b884-9bca93f496b3"]},{"id":"47cae8e7-0b9c-43a8-99d5-84b9baf45dde","name":"Axial","nick":"Axial","box":[827,47,37,45],"src":[]},{"id":"892b2708-448f-4d18-853e-246619180e4e","name":"Direction","nick":"Direction","box":[827,92,37,45],"src":[]},{"id":"b37fd18d-b7a5-4ca2-837f-0613d6077ba7","name":"NumIncr","nick":"NumIncr","box":[827,137,37,45],"src":[]},{"id":"92bcec48-9857-4cc2-9b62-143801763080","name":"MaxPhi","nick":"MaxPhi","box":[827,182,37,45],"src":[]},{"id":"61e4dc8c-8ac3-43da-9c70-35b927165af9","name":"εud","nick":"εud","box":[827,227,37,45],"src":[]},{"id":"03b5d5c7-38bb-4df0-a7a5-d54c9a1c332d","name":"εcu","nick":"εcu","box":[827,272,37,45],"src":[]},{"id":"86fc2ca2-2a99-478c-9732-d1a19fd94195","name":"StopAtUltimate","nick":"StopAtUltimate","box":[827,317,37,45],"src":[]}],"outputs":[{"id":"290bf755-046a-4c2c-b7fd-c63529e6ed54","name":"log","nick":"log","box":[894,2,46,20],"src":[]},{"id":"f546cd95-8e71-47b6-8c38-31d87a769b11","name":"N","nick":"N","box":[894,22,46,20],"src":[]},{"id":"9558c5ee-8301-4b6b-9df9-20304bb0e1bc","name":"My","nick":"My","box":[894,42,46,20],"src":[]},{"id":"efeaa741-097f-4766-b37b-c589025f5a70","name":"Mz","nick":"Mz","box":[894,62,46,20],"src":[]},{"id":